function man_check_stage{parameter o to ves1["&lastengine"](). if stage:number>o{if maxthrust=0{wait 1. if maxthrust=0{ui["msg add"]("Stage: "+stage:number+" no thrust."). ves1["stage"]().}}else{local h to 0. local i to 0. local j to 0. local l to list(). list engines in l. local a is stage:number. for c in l{if c:stage=a{if c:flameout{set h to h+1.}if c:maxthrust>0 and c:allowshutdown set i to i+1.}else set j to j+1.}if h>0{if i>0 or j>0 ves1["stage"]().}}}}function find_burntime{parameter d,a to stage:number. local e to mass. local b to ship:stagedeltav(a):current. ui["msg add"]("Calculated STAGEDV for stage "+a+" is: "+b). local m to 9.80665. local n is list(). list engines in n. local f to 0.1. local g to 0.1. for k in n{if k:stage=a{set f to f+k:visp. set g to g+k:possiblethrust.}}if b>d{return d/(g*(((e+(e*(constant:e^(-1*(d/(f*m))))))/2)^(-1))).}else{if(a=0){ui["msg add"]("Not enough DV. "). print 0/1.}else{return b/(g*(((e+(e*(constant:e^(-1*(b/(f*m))))))/2)^(-1)))+find_burntime(d-b,max(a-1,0)).}}}
